         <pb n="1" facs="https://fredwah.ca/sites/default/files/A9_Breathin%20My%20Name%20with%20a%20Sigh%28CHP%20first%20draft%29.pdf#page=4"/>
         <div type="poem">
            <lg>
               <l>I like the purity of all things seen</l>
               <l>through the accumulation of thrust</l>
               <l>forward especially the vehicle</l>
               <l>container maybe / or <soCalled>thing</soCalled> called body</l>
               <l>because time seems to be only <emph>it</emph> appears</l>
               <l>to look into the green mountain valleys</l>
               <l>or through them to the rivers &amp; nutrient creeks</l>
               <l><emph>where</emph> was never the problem animal is</l>
               <l>I still have my own name its what they call me</l>
               <l><q>breathin</q> my name with a sigh<note place="foot">Unsure whether or not the terminal quotation mark here is intentional or whether the entire line is meant to be in quotation marks.</note></l>
            </lg>
         </div>
      </body>
